{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/灵巧闪身","pageid":6725,"revid":15161,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E5%B7%A7%E9%97%AA%E8%BA%AB&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E5%B7%A7%E9%97%AA%E8%BA%AB&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E5%B7%A7%E9%97%AA%E8%BA%AB&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>灵巧闪身</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.81.B5.E5.B7.A7.E9.97.AA.E8.BA.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灵巧闪身\"><b>灵巧闪身</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 灵巧闪身.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/5lqbpmtylk7m2qy23il2d2xo3qqna3h.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%B5%E5%B7%A7%E9%97%AA%E8%BA%AB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/5lqbpmtylk7m2qy23il2d2xo3qqna3h.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%81%B5%E5%B7%A7%E9%97%AA%E8%BA%AB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a5/5lqbpmtylk7m2qy23il2d2xo3qqna3h.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灵巧闪身\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">30%</font>。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正、侧面</span>]敌人主动单体攻击前，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]，可打断目标，并造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>魔法伤害，施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，再传送至<font color=\"#ed7950\">2~6</font>格最近友军身边；效果触发后，冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%B6%E5%A5%88%E6%B3%95\" title=\"角色图鉴库/叶奈法\"><img alt=\"头像 叶奈法.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cd/fozywzji2wod769h64yquanm1b0ozw8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" styl